## Model weights — downloaded, never vendored

No model weights are committed to this repository. They are fetched on first use, which keeps
their licences out of this distribution and keeps the clone small.

| Model | Role | Note |
|---|---|---|
| `kitsumed/yolov8m_seg-speech-bubble` | speech-bubble detection (~104 MB) | YOLOv8-seg export. **Verify the licence on the model page before redistributing anything derived from it.** Ultralytics YOLOv8 itself is AGPL-3.0. |
| `manga-ocr` base model | Japanese OCR (~424 MB) | fetched from Hugging Face on first run |

See `manga_models/README.md` for download URLs and the automatic-download behaviour.

